+    *   Set viewport to `(0, 0, g_winWidth, g_winHeight)` [S1, S4, unofficial].
+    *   Enable face culling and set `glCullFace` to `GL_FRONT` (culling front faces to render only back faces) [S1, S4, unofficial].
